                [ 'p', 'To estimate the payback period you need three numbers: the total start-up cost (laser, accessories, extraction, delivery), the margin on one item (selling price minus material, packaging and fees) and a realistic number of items you will sell per month.' ],
                [ 'p', 'Formula: months to payback = start-up cost ÷ (margin per item × items per month − fixed monthly costs).' ],
